OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be cloudy with showers or some
OL,7,Flonger spells of rain, perhaps heavy.
OL,8,FThen mainly dry overnight with just
OL,9,Fthe odd shower. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FStarting off mostly dry.
OL,12,FOtherwise a cloudy day with showers or
OL,13,Fsome longer spells of rain developing
OL,14,Fby afternoon. Showers will be heavy
OL,15,Fwith a chance of thunder.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FEarly
OL,18,Fshowers on Monday, then dry and
OL,19,Fbright. Early rain on Tuesday and
OL,20,FWednesday, then turning drier and
OL,21,Fbrighter from the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
